<p>While wielding a two handed weapon, your critical strike chance is increased by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3%, 5%, 6%, 8%, 10%,</acronym> and your melee criticals instill you with righteous strength, increasing all physical and light damage you deal by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">5%, 8%, 10%, 13%, 15%,</acronym> stacking up to 3 times.</p><p>In addition, your melee critical strikes leave a lasting lightburn on the target, dealing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">71, 96, 115, 131, 145</acronym> light damage over 5 turns and reducing opponents armour by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">5, 13, 19, 25, 30.</acronym></p><p>The damage increases with your Spellpower.</p>